{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>TVB台慶59周年盛事，63歲三屆視帝羅嘉良重返娘家舞台帶領逾100位藝員跳唱掀起全場高潮，有資深電視迷發現， …</p><p></p>\n<p>TVB台慶59周年盛事，63歲三屆視帝羅嘉良重返娘家舞台帶領逾100位藝員跳唱掀起全場高潮，有資深電視迷發現，原來當年TVB慶祝30周年，同樣由他主導開場，橫跨29年「奇哥」再次回歸，除了充滿集體回憶，也觸發網友討論明年「60周年」大騷應由誰負責領軍？ </p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179510887991183627_18904589886aff301064e5f.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"d6df56ec-ec8e-464c-a9c1-bc2a42827ab1.jpeg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179510887991183627_18904589886aff301064e5f.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>大會更特別安排逾100位藝員分批列隊步入舞台和唱，從新生代藝人到當家花旦林夏薇與龔嘉欣等盛裝亮相，最後鏡頭轉至停車場景集結陳豪及馬國明等一線小生壓陣，展現出極具氣勢的排場。（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<h2>羅嘉良神還原《難兄難弟》李奇造型震撼電視城</h2>\n<p>昨晚於將軍澳電視廣播城一廠舉行的年度大騷，汪明荃領軍逾200位藝員傾力演出，當中最大驚喜絕對落在重量級嘉賓身上。身穿全白西裝配搭復古黑超亮相舞台，羅嘉良以劇集經典角色造型強勢登場，身形挺拔且中氣十足獻唱《奇哥》及《難兄難弟》。</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179510888203179810_5001352946aff30127a62c.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"New Project - 2026-11-20T003839.415.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179510888203179810_5001352946aff30127a62c.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>1997年嘅TVB台慶，34歲嘅羅嘉良負責開場表演，陪伴左右仲有宣萱張可頤！（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<h2>無綫總動員逾100藝員大晒冷迎接羅嘉良回歸舞台</h2>\n<p>大會更特別安排逾100位藝員分批列隊步入舞台和唱，從新生代藝人到當家花旦林夏薇與龔嘉欣等盛裝亮相，最後鏡頭轉至停車場景集結陳豪及馬國明等一線小生壓陣，展現出極具氣勢的排場。</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179510889227972591_16132871026aff301cce582.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"VS--TVBJadeHongKongtimezoneTVBAnywhere-29918156’52”.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179510889227972591_16132871026aff301cce582.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<h2>橫跨29載《難兄難弟》曾主導30周年台慶大騷</h2>\n<p>今次安排資深觀眾的深刻記憶，翻查資料發現這齣懷舊喜劇與台慶一直存在深厚淵源，1997年11月19日舉行的30周年慶典上，大會同樣安排當年首播即成熱話的《難兄難弟》劇集主角擔大旗，由羅嘉良聯同宣萱及張可頤等主角在開場時載歌載舞。時隔29年後人事幾番新，昔日拍檔宣萱如今殺入商台叱咤樂壇角逐「我最喜愛的女歌手」，而這位男主角則選擇重返發跡地與一班後輩再度同台演出。</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179510889646557861_11708887446aff3021040f6.png\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"IG@ensonlau 的副本 (8).png/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179510889646557861_11708887446aff3021040f6.png\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>昔日拍檔宣萱如今殺入商台叱咤樂壇角逐「我最喜愛的女歌手」，而這位男主角則選擇重返發跡地與一班後輩再度同台演出，至於張可頤就淡出幕前享受生活。（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<h2>網民掀起熱議瘋狂預測60周年台慶領軍神秘人選</h2>\n<p>不少觀眾留言大讚羅嘉良狀態極佳，直指「到呢個年紀頭髮仲好茂盛！」、「一開口已經贏盡全場」及「經典神髓完全冇變過」。與此同時，由於明年即將迎來更加重要的里程碑，大眾焦點已經提前轉移至未來陣容佈局，網民紛紛提出「明年60周年台慶應該由誰領軍演出」終極懸念。網絡上開始湧現各種大膽推測，列出心目中期待破天荒復出的「退隱巨星」名單！</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179510890252269362_19545200456aff3026ed05b.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"2778b2e4-7b3c-45ac-a144-0617620b2f0b.jpeg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179510890252269362_19545200456aff3026ed05b.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>羅嘉良表現風騷，狀態十足！（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p>還有什麼演唱會消息？<i></i></p>\n<p>無論是本地歌手還是外地歌手都即將在香港舉行演唱會，即睇：<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E6%99%82%E9%96%93%E8%A1%A8-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8%E8%B3%87%E8%A8%8A-plt-777443/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">演唱會時間表及購票資訊</a></b>，包括<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/mirror%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E8%A3%9C%E5%A0%B4-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-816344/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">MIRROR演唱會門票兌換安排</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E5%AE%B9%E7%A5%96%E5%85%92%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E6%BE%B3%E9%96%80-%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-plt-801047/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">容祖兒</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E9%84%AD%E7%A7%80%E6%96%87-%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E7%B4%85%E9%A4%A8-plt-807968/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">鄭秀文</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E5%BC%B5%E5%AD%B8%E5%8F%8B-%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-786591/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">張學友</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E9%84%AD%E4%B8%AD%E5%9F%BA%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83%E6%BE%B3%E9%96%80-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-835218/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">鄭中基</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E6%BA%AB%E6%8B%BF%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E5%94%AE%E7%A5%A8-plt-829876/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">溫拿</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E7%BE%85%E5%BF%97%E7%A5%A5%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E5%BA%A7%E4%BD%8D%E8%A1%A8-plt-835184/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">羅志祥</a></b>等。</p>\n<p>除了演唱會，還有什麼消閒娛樂活動？<i></i></p>\n<p>喜愛宅在家的話，觀看<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/netflix%E6%8E%A8%E8%96%A6-%E7%BE%8E%E5%8A%87-%E6%97%A5%E9%9F%93%E5%8F%B0%E5%8A%87-plt-576203/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Netflix劇集</a></b>和<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/bl%E5%8A%87-netflix-plt-583838/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">BL劇</a></b>最好不過。如果喜歡外出走走的你，也可到這些<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95/%E5%AE%A4%E5%85%A7%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-629923/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">室內好去處</a></b>室內遊樂場、溜冰場、自助烘焙店等盡玩室內活動。想要親親大自然，也可到離島走一走，即睇：<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-%E5%81%87%E6%9C%9F%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-%E9%9B%A2%E5%B3%B6%E4%B8%80%E6%97%A5%E9%81%8A-%E6%A2%85%E7%AA%A9-%E6%9D%B1%E9%BE%8D%E5%B3%B6-gt01-420918/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">離島行程攻略</a></b>或是行山，這些<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E9%83%8A%E9%81%8A/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E8%A1%8C%E5%B1%B1%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-%E7%B0%A1%E5%96%AE%E5%88%9D%E7%B4%9A%E6%96%B0%E6%89%8B%E8%B7%AF%E7%B7%9A-org115-515293/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">行山好去處</a></b>路線簡易，新手也適合。</p>\n<p></p>\n<p>\n<i></i>\nTags :\n<a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e7%be%85%e5%98%89%e8%89%af/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">羅嘉良</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e8%90%ac%e5%8d%83%e6%98%9f%e8%bc%9d%e8%b3%80%e5%8f%b0%e6%85%b6/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">萬千星輝賀台慶</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e9%9b%a3%e5%85%84%e9%9b%a3%e5%bc%9f/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">難兄難弟</a> </p>\n<p>\n<i></i>\n<p>\n資料或影片來源：<a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/3546414\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">原文刊於新假期</a>\n</p>\n</p><p></p>\n<a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/category/%e7%94%9f%e6%b4%bb/%e5%a8%9b%e6%a8%82/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">娛樂</a>\nNov 20 2026\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<p></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-20T02:43:53.651381+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1399,"images":5,"source":"GoTrip","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-20T01:21:50+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-20T02:37:27.698375+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-20T02:37:27.698375+00:00","content_hash":"58d835f77e644af1c542d9f218baf4e2349668bf6b419cd2a2f5d5a2b4c4de70","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}